    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"### Curvas precision-recall (val)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Con clases desbalanceadas, la curva PR es más informativa que la ROC para la clase minoritaria: la ROC usa la tasa de\\n\",\n",
    "    \"falsos positivos, que casi no se mueve porque SCC tiene muchísimos negativos (MEL + BCC); la PR usa la **precisión**,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"que sí cae con cada falso positivo. El nivel del azar en PR es la **prevalencia** de la clase (línea discontinua),\\n\",\n",
    "    \"no 0.5 como en la ROC.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Izquierda: el mejor modelo, una curva por clase (one-vs-rest).\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Derecha: SCC para todos los modelos.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- El punto marca dónde cae la predicción actual (argmax), es decir, el recall y la precisión que se obtienen hoy.\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {\n",
    "    \"ExecuteTime\": {\n",
    "     \"end_time\": \"2026-10-21T16:06:24.282491700Z\",\n",
    "     \"start_time\": \"2026-10-21T16:06:23.849926500Z\"\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   },\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"Yva = label_binarize(yva, classes=list(range(len(CLASSES))))\\n\",\n",
    "    \"colors = {\\\"mel\\\": \\\"#1f77b4\\\", \\\"bcc\\\": \\\"#ff7f0e\\\", \\\"scc\\\": \\\"#2ca02c\\\"}\\n\",\n",
    "    \"fig, axs = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(13, 5))\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"for j, c in enumerate(CLASSES):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    prec, rec, _ = precision_recall_curve(Yva[:, j], probas[best][:, j])\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    ap = average_precision_score(Yva[:, j], probas[best][:, j])\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    axs[0].plot(rec, prec, color=colors.get(c), label=f\\\"{c} (AP {ap:.3f})\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    axs[0].axhline(Yva[:, j].mean(), color=colors.get(c), ls=\\\"--\\\", lw=0.8)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    hit = preds[best] == j\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    if hit.any():\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        axs[0].plot(recall_score(Yva[:, j], hit), (Yva[hit, j]).mean(), \\\"o\\\", color=colors.get(c))\\n\",\n",
    "    \"axs[0].set(xlabel=\\\"recall\\\", ylabel=\\\"precisión\\\", title=f\\\"{best}: PR por clase\\\", xlim=(0, 1), ylim=(0, 1.02))\\n\",\n",
    "    \"axs[0].legend(loc=\\\"lower left\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
